      deck: "Standard 52-card pack (French suits). In Royal Casino the court cards have numerical capture values: Jacks 11, Queens 12, Kings 13; number cards use face value; Aces count as 1 or 14 at the player's choice. The same deck is used for capture, building, and trailing as in Casino.",
      equipment: 'Standard deck.',
      dealing: '4 each; 4 face up on table. Deal 4 more when hands empty.',
