    turnFlow: '1. Must play exactly one card. 2. Capture: match loose card or sum; or capture build. 3. Build: combine with table cards; owner must hold matching card. 4. Trail: leave card on table if no match. Cannot trail if played card equals loose card. Owner of build cannot trail. 5. Sweeps (clearing table) score extra.',
